@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 60

actor Pengguna as User
boundary HalamanDetailArtikelUI as ArtikelUI
control LikeController as Controller

== Main Flow ==

User -> ArtikelUI : 1: Buka halaman detail artikel
activate ArtikelUI
ArtikelUI --> User : 1.1: Tampilkan tombol like beserta jumlah like saat ini

alt [Pengguna belum like]
    User -> ArtikelUI : 2: Klik tombol "Like"
    ArtikelUI -> Controller : 2.1: toggleLike(artikelId)
    activate Controller
    Controller --> ArtikelUI : 2.1.1: Like berhasil
    ArtikelUI --> User : 2.1.2: Perbarui jumlah like di UI
    deactivate Controller
else [Pengguna sudah pernah like]
    User -> ArtikelUI : 2a: Klik tombol "Unlike"
    ArtikelUI -> Controller : 2a.1: toggleLike(artikelId)
    activate Controller
    Controller --> ArtikelUI : 2a.1.1: Unlike berhasil
    ArtikelUI --> User : 2a.1.2: Kurangi jumlah like di UI
    deactivate Controller
end

deactivate ArtikelUI

@enduml
